# {{DISPLAY_NAME}} client usage

The `{{NPM_NAME}}` and `{{PYTHON_NAME}}` packages call Crawlora's hosted API. Set `CRAWLORA_API_KEY` to a key for your Crawlora account before making requests. Service usage is billed under that account. These clients do not run a browser or scrape {{DISPLAY_NAME}} locally; Crawlora is independent from and not endorsed by {{DISPLAY_NAME}} or its owners.

Both packages expose all {{OPERATION_COUNT}} operations in the bundled API contract. JavaScript uses camelCase methods and Python uses snake_case methods. Methods also remain available through the `{{PLATFORM}}` group and the generated `Client` alias.

